 After a comma in a key, whitespace is skipped: spaces, tabs, or a line break with the next key on the line below
objects	l1, l2, l3 light
deltas	initial	l1, l2, l3	castShadow true
deltas	initial	l1,	l2	intensity .4

 A long list goes one key per line. The comma at the end says the list goes on.
servers	alpha,
	beta,
	gamma
		port 80
		region us-east

 The continuation may hang deeper or keep the first line's indent; the line has the first line's indent either way
lights
	key,
	fill,
	rim	castShadow true

 Leaves too, and the header of a multiline string
x, y 1
query,
backup sql
	SELECT name FROM users
	WHERE age > 30
